STRING 7325
{
Assassin:
Favorite role of most players. Not a surprise, since those heroes are specialized in killing other heroes and thus boosting a player's ELO (and that's the problem with the current ELO system, but I digress). Most skills of a tipical hero of this role are long range, single-target and mostly have some kind of nice combo (also known as "MC" /sarcasm). Another characteristic of this role is that they are mid/late game characters. They just really shine once they get their elemental weapons.
Most ninjutsu heroes fit in this role. 
Example of heroes in this category: Asuma, Minato, Tenten, Darui, Suigetsu. 
As an assassin, your goal is to sneakily pass through the enemy's frontline and obliterate their assassins and supports. Your biggest fear, however, must be mass of players. Avoid them at any cost! Recommended items: Ninja Shippu Shoes, Elemental Weapon (great stats boost but expensive, rush it), Blink Stone/Body-Replace doll (to pass through the enemy's frontline and easy escape after finishing your "job"). Common mistakes: Forgetting this is a team game and trying to play solo; not walking along your support allies. 
}

