STRING 8080
{
Destroyer:
We talked about the Assassin previously and discussed about how they are designed to kill one hero. Destroyers are designed to kill heroes as well, with the difference that they are designed to kill mass of heroes.  Most skills of a tipical hero of this role are point target with area of effect. Another strong characteristic of this role is that they sometimes have semi-ultimates that deal fixed chaos damage, thus allowing them to be very good earliers, but terrible at mid-game and just recovering once they get their ultimates. Oh, almost forgot: They have the best farming skills of whole game!
Most genjutsu heroes fit in this role.
Exemple of heroes in this category: Kakuzu, Madara, Danzo, Kabuto, Mei, Konan.
The destroyer is divided in two subcategories: Hero destroyer and base destroyer. As a base destroyer, your goal is to take your enemies' bases out. They are not just important, but essential in modes like Normal Mode. However, they are somewhat weak against heroes, as their spells are mostly easy to escape. Recommended items: Legendary weapon (best weapon after Eight-Headed Serpent, great stats boost), Teleport Shoes (excellent to teleport to a creep nearby an enemy base and so start a furtive attack), Kage Robe (you need to be able to tank the damage of towers and base). Common mistakes: Wasting your powerful and precious ultimate to kill heroes, when you could get so much more gold and points going to their bases. 
The second subcategory is called hero destroyer and the second most favorite role of the game. They are truly specialized in killing mass of players, and have necessarily in their arsenals some area of effect stun or another crowd-control. However, they are still weak against single heroes, as they don't have the range and damage sustain that assassins have. Recommended items: Legendary weapon (your good farming skill will allow you to afford it), Ninja Net (don't care about those people calling you noob for it!), Jade of Susano'o/Asura Essence (for hp boost, since you are dealing with mass of players you need extra health). Common mistakes: Trying to solo players. The same mistakes of assassins are also commited by players of this role.
}

