STRING 10875
// Abilities: A0V4 (Ultimate Choice), Ubertip (Tooltip - Normal - Extended)
{
Choose between Perfect Susano'o and Chibaku Tensei as your ultimate.|n|cff87ceebPerfect Susano'o:|r|n|cff32cd32Target Type:|r Instant Target|n|cff32cd32Effects:|r Grants you damage immunity after the first hit taken and gives 25% chance to deal 2 x Ninjutsu + 250 magic damage. Also unlock Indra's Arrow. Last 25 seconds.|n|cffff0000Can protect up to 5000 damage. Also provides a passive which reduces 10% damage taken.|r|n|cff32cd32Chakra Cost:|r 400|n|cff32cd32Cooldown:|r 140s|n|cff32cd32Description:|r|nThe ultimate uchiha jutsu which calls an battle avatar to protect the user.|n|cff87ceebChibaku Tensei:|r|n|cff32cd32Target Type:|r Instant|n|cff32cd32Targets Allowed:|r Enemy|n|cff32cd32Damage:|r 8 x Ninjutsu + 800|n|cff32cd32Damage Type:|r Chaos|n|cff32cd32Area of Effect:|r 500|n|cff32cd32Chakra Cost:|r 450|n|cff32cd32Cooldown:|r 70s|n|cff32cd32Description:|r|nA special technique developed by Rikuudou Senin. The user creates a black sphere of gravity that, when thrown into the sky, attracts objects from all directions.|n|cffff0000Requires:|n- Level 35.|r
}

STRING 10876
// Abilities: A0VR (HyuugaSilence), Ubertip (Tooltip - Normal - Extended)
{
|cff32cd32Target Type:|r Unit Target|n|cff32cd32Targets Allowed:|r Enemy|n|cff32cd32Casting Range:|r 180|n|cff32cd32Damage:|r 2 x Ninjutsu + |cff87ceeb650 x skill level|r|n|cff32cd32Damage Type:|r Chaos|n|cff32cd32Effects:|r If Byakugan is activated, burns target's |cff87ceeb300 x skill level|r chakra and silence it for 3s.|cff32cd32Chakra Cost:|r 240 + |cff87ceeb30 x skill level|r|n|cff32cd32Cooldown:|r 50s|n|cff32cd32Description:|r|nThe Eight Trigrams Thirty-Two Palms is a manoeuvre of the Gentle Fist fighting style. It is essentially a halved version of the Eight Trigrams Sixty-Four Palms, but seems to be no less effective. This technique is used to close off the flow of chakra through thirty-two chakra points of an opponent's chakra pathway system.
}

