{
|cff32cd32Target Type:|r Instant|n|cff32cd32Targets Allowed:|r Enemy|n|cff32cd32Damage:|r |cff87ceebTaijutsu x skill level|r|n|cff32cd32Damage Type:|r Normal|n|cff32cd32Area of Effect:|r 220 width x 500 length|n|cff32cd32Effects:|r Last 6 seconds. Stuns for |cff87ceeb1.5s|r|n|cff32cd32Chakra Cost:|r 15 + |cff87ceeb15 x skill level|r|n|cff32cd32Cooldown:|r 13s + |cff87ceeb1 x skill level|r|n|cff32cd32Description:|r|nA powerful A-rank technique developed by Yondaime Hokage and taught to Naruto through Jiraiya. Naruto concentrates chakra on the palm of his hand and makes it spin in high speed, creating a massive sphere of spiral chakra that deals damage to the first enemy he attacks.
