{
|cff32cd32Target Type:|r Unit Target|n|cff32cd32Targets Allowed:|r Enemy|n|cff32cd32Casting Range:|r 700|n|cff32cd32Damage:|r |cff87ceebGenjutsu x skill level (Genjutsu x skill level x 1.2 if Hitomi Goku is activated)|r|n|cff32cd32Damage Type:|r Magic|n|cff32cd32Effects:|r Stun the target for two seconds and deal damage after five seconds.|n|cff32cd32Chakra Cost:|r 0 + |cff87ceeb20 x skill level|r|n|cff32cd32Cooldown:|r 10s|n|cff32cd32Description:|r|nChiyo performs a variation of the technique by attaching threads generated for the Puppet Technique to the blades and suppressing her chakra as much as possible that they will be unnoticeable. In doing this, she is able to transfer the threads from one weapon to that of the enemies for an added surprise or advantage during battle.|n|cffff0000Care: You need to use Soshujin before casting this technique.|r
}

STRING 13234
// Abilities: A0FC (|cff8b4600Doton: Ishi|r), Ubertip (Tooltip - Normal - Extended)
{
|cff32cd32Target Type:|r Unit Target|n|cff32cd32Targets Allowed:|r Enemy|n|cff32cd32Casting Range:|r 700|n|cff32cd32Damage:|r |cff87ceebGenjutsu x skill level (Genjutsu x skill level x 1.2 if Hitomi Goku is activated)|r|n|cff32cd32Damage Type:|r Magic|n|cff32cd32Effects:|r Stun the target for two seconds and deal damage after five seconds.|n|cff32cd32Chakra Cost:|r 0 + |cff87ceeb20 x skill level|r|n|cff32cd32Cooldown:|r 10s|n|cff32cd32Description:|r|nChiyo performs a variation of the technique by attaching threads generated for the Puppet Technique to the blades and suppressing her chakra as much as possible that they will be unnoticeable. In doing this, she is able to transfer the threads from one weapon to that of the enemies for an added surprise or advantage during battle.|n|cffff0000Care: You need to use Soshujin before casting this technique.|r
}

