STRING 15021
{
Commands
}

STRING 15022
{
|cffffcc00-duel:|r Invite someone to duel
|cffffcc00-tip:|r Show a tip 
|cffffcc00-autobuy:|r Enable automatic buy of items
|cffffcc00-killme:|r Kill your hero in 10s. (Use only when you get stuck)
|cffffcc00-afk:|r Kick an afk player.
|cffffcc00-b SLOT:|r Add an item on your bank of a determined slot. Example: -bank 1
|cffffcc00-r SLOT:|r Remove an item from your bank of a determined slot. Example: -remove 1
|cffffcc00-g AMOUNT:|r Send gold to a player. 
|cffffcc00-c AMOUNT:|r Send crystal to a player.
|cffffcc00-z DISTANCE:|r Zoom the view of the map. Example: -zoom 2000
|cffffcc00-lock:|r Lock camera to the current selected unit
|cffffcc00-unlock:|r Unlock camera 
|cffffcc00-damage:|r List the damages you received or dealt
|cffffcc00-damages:|r List the damages dealt and receive of all players
|cffffcc00-ms:|r Show the current movement speed of your hero
|cffffcc00-resetms:|r Fix bugged movement speed (remove your shoes first)
|cffffcc00-range X:|r Show a determined range around your hero
|cffffcc00-rangeoff:|r Hide the range indication
|cffffcc00-switch:|r Switch from team
|cffffcc00-stream:|r Enable automatic camera mode (only observers)
|cffffcc00-tai x:|r Exchanges x crystals for x taijutsu points
|cffffcc00-nin x:|r Exchanges x crystals for x ninjutsu points
|cffffcc00-gen x:|r Exchanges x crystals for x genjutsu points
|cffffcc00-xp x:|r Exchanges 500x gold for 800x experience
}

STRING 15023
{
Game modes
}

STRING 15024
{
|cffffcc00Normal mode:|r The objective is to destroy your enemy base. Game is over when all enemies' bases are destroyed.
|cffffcc00Time mode:|r The objective is to get more points as possible in a given time period. The winner team is the one who gets the most quantity of points. You gain points killing enemy heroes (+10 points) or destroying towers (+3 points). You lose points upon death (-5 points).
}

STRING 15025
{
Team matching
}

STRING 15026
{
Team matching is a system that enables special status when the heroes present in each team matches a certain combination. Available matches:

|cffffcc00- Team 7: Naruto + Sakura + Sasuke / Sai|r (Start with Chakra Stone item)
|cffffcc00- Team 8: Hinata + Kiba + Shino|r (starts with HP stone)
|cffffcc00- Team 10: Shikamaru + Chouji + Ino|r (gains 200 xp (to lvl. 4))
|cffffcc00- Team Gai: Neji + Lee + Tenten|r (increases attack speed of all teammates by 25%)
|cffffcc00- Jounins Of Konoha: Kakashi + Asuma + Kurenai|r (starts with chakra sweets and sushi)
|cffffcc00- The Hokages: Hashirama + Tobirama + Hiruzen|r (starts with ninja badge)
|cffffcc00- Team Medical: Tsunade + Sakura + Ino|r (gains a passive that heals 300 HP every 30 seconds)
|cffffcc00- Hiraishin Team: Naruto + Minato|r (they get a Hirashin Kunai)
|cffffcc00- Legendary Sannins: Tsunade + Jiraiya + Orochimaru|r (Passive that reduces melee attacks damage)
|cffffcc00- Suna Siblings: Gaara + Temari + Kankuro|r (gains a passive that increases movement speed by 60 (equivalent to lvl. 1 boots))
|cffffcc00- Team Kumogakure Ninjas: A + Bee + Darui|r (increases armor of all teammates by 20)
|cffffcc00- Missing Ninja Duo: Zabuza + Haku|r (start with smoke bomb)
|cffffcc00- Swordmen Of Mist: Kisame + Zabuza + Ringo|r (starts with the big moon sword)
|cffffcc00- The Mizukages: Gengetsu + Yagura + Mei|r (starts with a "false" spirit of water)
|cffffcc00- Team Amegakure Orphans: Nagato + Konan|r (One additional tensei book)
|cffffcc00- Team Akatsuki Artists: Deidara + Sasori|r (1 additional genjutsu each time they level up)
|cffffcc00- Team Zombie Combo: Kakuzu + Hidan|r (reduced revive time by 10s)
|cffffcc00- Team Betrayers: Itachi + Kisame|r (each one starts with 800 gold)
|cffffcc00- Taka Team: Sasuke + Karin + Suigetsu / Juugo|r (They get lvl. 1 invisibility shoes)
}

STRING 15027
{
Rivals
}

STRING 15028
{
When killing a rival, you gain 300 additional gold and one point. Available rivals:

- Naruto & Sasuke
- Naruto & Konohamaru
- Ino & Sakura
- Hashirama & Madara
- Kakashi & Gai
- Kakashi & Obito
- Danzo & Hiruzen
- Sasuke & Itachi
- Lee & Neji
- Mu & Gengetsu
- Jounin Minato & Raikage
- Hinata & Neji
- Curse Sasuke & Itachi
- Jiraiya & Orochimaru
- Killer Bee & Raikage
- Jirobo & Chouji
- Anbu Itachi & Danzo
- Kidomaru & Neji
- Hidan & Shikamaru
- Gaara & Kimimaro
- Kurenai & Itachi
- Mifune & Hanzo
}

STRING 15029
{
Unique items
}

STRING 15030
{
Some items can display special effects when carried by certain heroes. The list of all unique items is the following:

|cffffcc00Tobirama + Lvl. 10 Shuriken:|r Tobirama can cast 'Space-Time Barrier' instead of 'Space-Time Jutsu', that slows all enemies around the caster.
|cffffcc00Haku + Ice Senbons:|r Sudden Ice Storm affects a fan-like area instead of line. 
|cffffcc00Naruto + Kyuubi's Lost Spear:|r Naruto gains a passive that regenerates chakra of nearby allies and increases armor (only Kurama's Jinchuuriki). Six Tails's Roar stun enemies for two seconds (only Sennin Mode).
|cffffcc00Hidan + Triple-Bladed Scythe:|r Increase life regeneration range of his circle.
|cffffcc00Hiruzen + Adamantine Staff:|r Enma becomes permanent and deals double damage chaos attack
|cffffcc00Temari + Iron Fan:|r Iron Fan Mastery triggers every second hit
|cffffcc00Itachi + Sword of Totsuka|r Tsukuyomi deals an additional 3 x Genjutsu
}

STRING 15031
{
Heroes role
}

STRING 15032
{
There are four main roles in Ninpou:
- Support
- Tracker
- Assassin
- Destroyer

See the sections below to know details about each one.
}

