{
|c00c0c0c0The hero canalizes lightnings to form a pyramid and imprision his enemys within pure energy. The static attraction will pull them up into the sky to discharge them and let them fall back on the ground to shatter or daze their allies. Heroes will be affected first because they generate more electricity. For the same reason dazed units won't be affected since they don't generate enough frictional electricity.|r

|c008080ffInstant
