STRING 18201
// Abilities: A00L (Red Secret Technique: Perfomance of a Hundred Puppets), Ubertip (Tooltip - Normal - Extended)
{
|cff32cd32Target Type:|r Instant|n|cff32cd32Targets Allowed:|r Enemy|n|cff32cd32Damage:|r Each puppet attack deals 75 normal damage, if you pick this as your T and are in Sandaime Kazekage form then the puppets deal Tai/6 Chaos damage.|n|cff32cd32Damage Type:|r Normal|n|cff32cd32Effects:|r Summon 20 puppets to attack surrounded enemies. Last 40 seconds.|n|cff32cd32Chakra Cost:|r 300|n|cff32cd32Cooldown:|r 120s|n|cff32cd32Description:|r|nTo begin this technique, Sasori removes one summoning scroll from his back. He then opens his right chest compartment to emit more than a hundred chakra strings, which reach into the scroll. From the scroll, more than a hundred puppets wearing red cloaks emerge.
