// Abilities: A0PR (HagoromoD), Ubertip (Tooltip - Normal - Extended)
{
|cff32cd32Target Type:|r NA|n|cff32cd32Targets Allowed:|r Self|n|cff32cd32Cooldown:|r 4 + (2 * Missing Charges) per recharge|n|cff32cd32Description:|r Hagoromo wields elemental jutsus, using 1 charge for single releases or 2 charges for combined releases. Starts with 3 charges; gains +1 at levels 10, 15, 35, and +2 at level 50 (8 max). Charges replenish every 4 + (2 * Missing Charges) seconds.

|nUnique Cast Rule: Every 4 spells must be unique.
|nSpell Cancel: Press Escape.
|nCharge Replenishment: Kill restores 3 charges (or 1 if diminished), assists restore 1 charge. Diminishing returns apply during kill streaks.
}

