STRING 20746
// Abilities: A0MO (Demon Flute: Phantom Wave), Researchubertip (Tooltip - Learn - Extended)
{
|cff32cd32Target Type:|r Instant |n|cff32cd32Targets Allowed:|r Enemy |n|cff32cd32Damage:|r |cff87ceeb5% Max Chakra + (Gen + Tai + Nin)/2|r, Max chakra caps at 350 and a minimum of 200 |cff87ceeb|n|cff32cd32Chakra Drain:|r 20% Target Max Chakra per Worm |n|cff32cd32Damage Type:|r Chaos |n|cff32cd32|cff32cd32Chakra Cost:|r 400 |n|cff32cd32Cooldown:|r 80s |n|cff32cd32Description:|r|nTayuya summons a swarm of 3 Chakra Worms around her and her Dokis. Chakra Worms launch themselves periodically at nearby enemies dealing damage and draining mana. If Chakra Worms hit an enemy without mana it will deal the amount drained as damage instead.
}

