// Abilities: A0LJ (Explode!), Ubertip (Tooltip - Normal - Extended)
{
Chiyo performs a variation of the technique by attaching threads generated for the Puppet Technique to the blades and suppressing her chakra as much as possible that they will be unnoticeable. In doing this, she is able to transfer the threads from one weapon to that of the enemies for an added surprise or advantage during battle.|n|cff87ceebPicks the kunais released during Soushujin and sends them to a target enemy, dealing Genjutsu X Ability-Level.|n|cffff0000Caution: It's necessary you cast Soushujin before to use this technique.|r
}

